{"v":4,"catch":"通過終極的遊戲控制來征服最高的摩天大樓！！","desc":"“CRAZY CLIMBER2”是Nichibutsu在1988年發布的動作遊戲。\n這是CRAZY CLIMBER系列中頗受歡迎的第一期的續集。\n這次比賽是在美國進行的，當您爬上建築物時，會有更好的陷阱和麻煩製造者擋在您的路上。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2020-05-28","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c4a02b72cd281898f8664d6542d511409d5b5181e297e17ff63031378c4f8d95.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f0a817cb0a4807e821a3db436609353c4339c76327b56e61bec1d33d890763f0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/03e2324b04aa240c569db18cd33df0b59d265e5eb9d1c49d0b78a0f5a84db4aa.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b9bbaef2868df0d3e9484647b01a1170380864683cf0b079295f056a02359651.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/27b7e1f02030a13a780783006ca1fa06bc108fda0059dfc5f57993717a66b532.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/29aaada8cca9429393cd7c486b33c5fa6094a0c83f2e58f735a22062c95b8350.jpg"],"titleId":"010055b009814000","dlc":[]}